es/comments/5329835751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122509#issuecomment-5329835751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122509","id":5329835751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPa7W5w","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T14:45:17Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T14:48:33Z","body":"It is not happening in v4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe] so it looks like it started after that\n\n> I think your inspector's width is less than mine.\n\nYeah looks like inspector width can be smaller now","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5329835751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5333198202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122509#issuecomment-5333198202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122509","id":5333198202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPeIleg","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T19:44:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T19:44:13Z","body":"I got it.\nIf the inspector's width is too small, the `text_limit` here will be negative.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/944a3c6cbbbb88284feebcb0603464cb175fa18e/editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp#L670-L675\nThen, `p_clip_r` (clip right edge) will be negative.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/944a3c6cbbbb88284feebcb0603464cb175fa18e/servers/text/text_server.cpp#L1749-L1751\nIn the function, data validation is performed here.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/944a3c6cbbbb88284feebcb0603464cb175fa18e/servers/text/text_server.cpp#L1793-L1804\nIf the param is negative, the loop will not break.\nSo, the string is fully display.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5333198202/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]